1.  **Shopping Experience**: Browse [Collections Catalog](http://localhost:3000/products), use the filters sidebar, click a product to test the **magnifying zoom**, add elements, apply coupons (e.g. `FASHION20`), scan the **UPI QR Code** mockup, and complete checkout.
